/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Design\040science\040in\040information\040systems\040research)
/Author (Alan\040R\056\040Hevner\054\040Salvatore\040T\056\040March\054\040Jinsoo\040Park\054\040Sudha\040Ram)
/Subject (Two\040paradigms\040characterize\040much\040of\040the\040research\040in\040the\040Information\040Systems\040discipline\072\040behavioral\040science\040and\040design\040science\040The\040behavioral\055science\040paradigm\040seeks\040to\040develop\040and\040verify\040theories\040that\040explain\040or\040predict\040human\040or\040organizational\040behavior\040The\040design\055science\040paradigm\040seeks\040to\040extend\040the\040boundaries\040of\040human\040and\040organizational\040capabilities\040by\040creating\040new\040and\040innovative\040artifacts\040Both\040paradigms\040are\040foundational\040to\040the\040IS\040discipline\054\040positioned\040as\040it\040is\040at\040the\040confluence\040of\040people\054\040organizations\054\040and\040technology\040Our\040objective\040is\040to\040describe\040the\040performance\040of\040design\055science\040research\040in\040Information\040Systems\040via\040a\040concise\040conceptual\040framework\040and\040clear\040guidelines\040for\040understanding\054\040executing\054\040and\040evaluating\040the\040research\040In\040the\040design\055science\040paradigm\054\040knowledge\040and\040understanding\040of\040a\040problem\040domain\040and\040its\040solution\040are\040achieved\040in\040the\040building\040and\040application\040of\040the\040designed\040artifact\040Three\040recent\040exemplars\040in\040the\040research\040literature\040are\040used\040to\040demonstrate\040the\040application\040of\040these\040guidelines\040We\040conclude\040with\040an\040analysis\040of\040the\040challenges\040of\040performing\040high\055quality\040design\055science\040research\040in\040the\040context\040of\040the\040broader\040IS\040community)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402004\054\040Management\040Information\040Systems\040Quarterly\054\040Design\040science\040research\054\040Information\040system\054\040Design\040science\054\040Normalized\040systems\054\040Problem\040domain\054\040University\040of\040South\040Florida\054\040Vanderbilt\040University\054\040College\040of\040Business\040Administration\054\040University\040of\040Arizona)
>>
